From: Armada <noreply@armada.local>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: disable the QCE crypto engine on SM8250/SM8550/SM8650/SM8750

Linux 7.3 made CRYPTO_DEV_QCE depend on BROKEN, so nothing can bind to
crypto@1dfa000 any more. With fw_devlink.strict=1 the unprobed consumer
keeps the interconnect providers from reaching sync_state, which leaves
every BCM voted at its maximum in the active, wake and sleep sets.
Disable the node so the providers sync and drop to real votes.

This is also what keeps the SM8750 display working across a power
collapse: MDSS does not survive losing its state while the multimedia
NoC is still voted on. The first DSI bring-up afterwards completes one
command and then leaves the command engine stuck, and a system resume
can block in dpm_complete. With the votes pinned at maximum that was
every suspend and every blank.

---
diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8250.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8250.dtsi
index c60a27bc4205..5400b3000a0f 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8250.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8250.dtsi
@@ -2653,6 +2653,9 @@ crypto: crypto@1dfa000 {
 				 <&apps_smmu 0x596 0x0011>;
 			interconnects = <&aggre2_noc MASTER_CRYPTO_CORE_0 0 &mc_virt SLAVE_EBI_CH0 0>;
 			interconnect-names = "memory";
+
+			/* CRYPTO_DEV_QCE depends on BROKEN since Linux 7.3 */
+			status = "disabled";
 		};
 
 		tcsr_mutex: hwlock@1f40000 {
diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8550.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8550.dtsi
index 276c5b8af7c5..65d697da6ef3 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8550.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8550.dtsi
@@ -2733,6 +2733,9 @@ crypto: crypto@1dfa000 {
 			interconnects = <&aggre2_noc MASTER_CRYPTO QCOM_ICC_TAG_ALWAYS
 					 &mc_virt SLAVE_EBI1 QCOM_ICC_TAG_ALWAYS>;
 			interconnect-names = "memory";
+
+			/* CRYPTO_DEV_QCE depends on BROKEN since Linux 7.3 */
+			status = "disabled";
 		};
 
 		ufs_mem_phy: phy@1d80000 {
diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8650.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8650.dtsi
index d9619bc33346..9fabe85b3779 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8650.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8650.dtsi
@@ -4185,6 +4185,9 @@ crypto: crypto@1dfa000 {
 
 			iommus = <&apps_smmu 0x480 0>,
 				 <&apps_smmu 0x481 0>;
+
+			/* CRYPTO_DEV_QCE depends on BROKEN since Linux 7.3 */
+			status = "disabled";
 		};
 
 		tcsr_mutex: hwlock@1f40000 {
diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8750.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8750.dtsi
index cfbcea8ed048..1aeba72a2cc8 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8750.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8750.dtsi
@@ -2183,6 +2183,9 @@ crypto: crypto@1dfa000 {
 
 			iommus = <&apps_smmu 0x480 0>,
 				 <&apps_smmu 0x481 0>;
+
+			/* CRYPTO_DEV_QCE depends on BROKEN since Linux 7.3 */
+			status = "disabled";
 		};
 
 		tcsr_mutex: hwlock@1f40000 {
